  tutorialLines1:
  - Congratulations on your employment at Big Happy Burger! Today we're going to
    be going over the basics of your very important job.
  - This here is your station. Bask in its glory!
  - And look! Your very first customer has already arrived. Time to get to work!
  - 'This monitor shows you the orders you have to fill. Looks like this cheapskate
    only wants a few things.  '
  - That shouldn't take long at all. In fact, I bet the cook is already done making
    the stuff.
  - 'Press D to rotate towards the Hotplate Station! '
  - This screen shows you how much time is left until the food gets done. Looks like
    Chef is pretty slow today. Gonna have to dock his pay again.
  - While he's cooking, let's get a bag ready. Grab one from that slot over there
    by pressing and holding LEFT-CLICK!
  - Nice grabbin. I wish I had arms. Now place it on the counter by letting go of
    LEFT-CLICK.
  - God, FINALLY! Now we can fulfill the order.
  - You know the drill. Fries in the bag. Use the SCROLL-WHEEL to move it closer
    or further. Hurry now, the customer's waiting!!
  - Sorry if I seem on edge. Night shift forgot to restock the ketchup last night.
    Needless to say, they're fired.
  - 'Hey, you know what? Let''s go back to the order counter. There''s a computer
    we can use to restock. Press A to rotate again. '
  - Grab that joystick on the desk and use it to move the cursor on the computer.
    Move it over the "BUY" button on the screen.
  - 'Wow you''re suprisingly good with computers. Somebody went to college! Now just
    press the red button to click "BUY" and wait for the supplies to arrive. '
  - While we're waiting, I wanna level with you. This company is within weeks of
    bankrupcy, and there's no job security or mobility.
  - I've been waiting on a bonus check for three years. Every time I ask corporate
    about it they plug their ears and pretend I'm not in the room.
  - 'I owe a lot of a bad people money. Eventually, I think I''m gonna have to take
    some drastic actio '
  - OH, hey look. The stuff is here. Let's finish that order! Go back to the hotplate
    and put ketchup in the bag.
  - "Oops! In all this chaos, we almost forgot the napkins! That\u2019s a hangable
    offense around here. Hahah\u2026"
  - Seriously though. EVERY order needs napkins. Put them in the bag. If you ran
    out somehow, restock them first like I taught you.
  - Alright! Now for the perfect handoff. Hold onto the bag and rotate to the Drive-Thru
    Window.
  - There they are. Open the window by using its handle and move the bag to the customer
    to give it to them by moving the bag with scroll wheel. Be sure to smile!
  - "Alright! Just do that 1000 more times and PERHAPS you\u2019ll earn a promotion."
  - If you manage to not mess up any of the orders, that is.
  - What? You want to learn how to make sodas? Sure, pal. Your funeral. Let's look
    at what the customer wants on the order screen.
  - "Let\u2019s go to the drink station. Press A or D to get there from here."
  - Take a cup from the side there and place it on the conveyor under the dispenser,
    then watch the magic!
  - Don't forget to put a lid on the drink! Don't want any nasty spills.
  - Now take it to that customer over there at the window... there is one there,
    right? I'm too short to see out the window.
  - "Alright that\u2019s it! Let\u2019s go back inside and wrap up orientation. Go
    back to the order screen for me real quick."
  - I think you're ready for the big leagues. I'll let you take it from here.
  - "One last thing. See this timer on the order? Don\u2019t let it count down to
    zero, or the customer will leave and you\u2019ll be written up."
  - I'm watching you.
  tutorialLines2:
  - Heya. Don't mind me, just wanted to share a lil' pro-tip with ya.
  - If you want to empty a bag of its contents, press RIGHT-CLICK to turn it over
    and give it a little shake to make stuff fall out.
  - "Honestly it\u2019s super therapeutic. You\u2019ll thank me later."
  - "ALSO! If you wanna buy some extra time, why not try sweet-talkin\u2019 the customer."
  - You can LEFT-CLICK a customer to greet them when they drive up, and if you say
    the right thing, they might be willing to wait a bit longer for their food.
  - "Just a suggestion. Go get em\u2019 today, tiger."
  tutorialLines3:
  - Today we're rolling out a new menu item...
  - Say hello to the all new, all original, CHICKEN SAMMIE (fries sold separately).
  - "It\u2019s important we get this launch right. I\u2019m counting on you, valued
    employee."
  tutorialLines4:
  - "Hey, you\u2019re good with kids right?"
  - Nevermind. Dumb question. Shouldn't make an employee babysit my children.
  - Speaking of children, watch out for orders with the BIG HAPPY BOX. It's a specialty
    item for the young'uns.
  - It comes with a CHICKEN NUGGET, an APPLE BAG, and a TOY. Make sure to put them
    in the special box!
  - "Gonna be a long night\u2026 I mean, day\u2026 Don\u2019t knock on my door."
  tutorialLines5:
  - "Ok, I\u2019m gonna level with ya. Today\u2019s gonna suck."
  - "Just got word from corporate that all of the Big Happy Burgers in town are shut
    down\u2026 except for ours."
  - Some maniac went and destroyed their generators last night. Who would do such
    a thing? And on Free Fry Friday!
  - "Oh well, more profits for us. Give \u2018em hell, champ!"
